flowchart TD
  Start([leaf open path]) --> IsDir{Directory?}
  IsDir -- no --> One[Open the single file]
  IsDir -- yes --> List[List the tree lazily]
  List --> Pick[Pick a file]
  One --> Kind{Kind?}
  Pick --> Kind
  Kind -- markdown --> MD[Render markdown]
  Kind -- diagram --> DG[Mermaid / PlantUML / Excalidraw]
  Kind -- code --> CM[CodeMirror, read only]
  Kind -- image / media --> IMG[Picture on a checkerboard]
  Kind -- csv / tsv --> TBL[Sortable, filterable table]
  Kind -- other --> BIN[Icon + metadata + download]
  MD --> Live[[Live updates over WebSocket]]
  DG --> Live
  CM --> Live
  Live --> Stage[Zoom in: hand, pencil, sticky ink]
  style Start fill:#dff5e6,stroke:#1e8e4d,color:#14532d
  style Live fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#3e82f7,color:#1e3a6e
